Actseal narrows those primitives to simultaneous selective-risk and coverage
assessment. It does not incorporate ARCI's execution engine or gate protocol.
Canonical hashing and self-sealing evidence are also informed by the public
evalopt-graph design. No evalopt-graph source implementation is included.
